#: ../../site/maintainer/README.md:1
msgid "Maintainer notes"
msgstr "维护者说明"

#: ../../site/maintainer/README.md:3
msgid "Comment rounds"
msgstr "注释轮次"

#: ../../site/maintainer/README.md:5
msgid "Freeze the public symbol list with `tools/build_api_ledger.py`."
msgstr "使用 `tools/build_api_ledger.py` 冻结公共符号清单。"

#: ../../site/maintainer/README.md:6
msgid ""
"Edit one module's public headers; use `///` Google-style contracts and "
"`///<` for concise fields/enum values. Do not change code or formatting."
msgstr "一次只编辑一个模块的公共头文件；使用 `///` 编写 Google 风格契约，使用 `///<` 简要说明字段/枚举值。不要改变代码或格式。"

#: ../../site/maintainer/README.md:8
msgid "Run `tools/check_comment_only.py` on the touched headers."
msgstr "对涉及的头文件运行 `tools/check_comment_only.py`。"

#: ../../site/maintainer/README.md:9
msgid "Regenerate Doxygen XML and the ledger; record documented/missing counts."
msgstr "重新生成 Doxygen XML 和符号清单；记录已说明/缺失数量。"

#: ../../site/maintainer/README.md:10
msgid "Run related tests (and the full suite for a release candidate)."
msgstr "运行相关测试（发布候选需运行完整测试套件）。"

#: ../../site/maintainer/README.md:11
msgid "Build both language sites with `-W -n --keep-going`."
msgstr "使用 `-W -n --keep-going` 构建两种语言的站点。"

#: ../../site/maintainer/README.md:12
msgid ""
"Update the English page, `.po` translation, page ledger and source links; "
"commit only the reviewed round."
msgstr "更新英文页面、`.po` 翻译、页面清单和源码链接；只提交已审阅的轮次。"

#: ../../site/maintainer/README.md:15
msgid "API pages"
msgstr "API 页面"

#: ../../site/maintainer/README.md:17
msgid ""
"`tools/generate_api_pages.py` rebuilds `docs/site/api/<module>.md` from the "
"committed ledger: one Breathe directive per top-level declaration, "
"overloaded functions emitted with their exact signature, template functions "
"by name, and multi-line string constants listed in the script's "
"`UNRENDERABLE` set. Edit the ledger inputs, not the generated pages; the "
"script is deterministic, so a reviewed round shows up as a small diff."
msgstr ""
"`tools/generate_api_pages.py` 依据已提交的符号清单重建 "
"`docs/site/api/<module>.md`：每个顶层声明一条 Breathe "
"指令，重载函数按完整签名输出，模板函数按名称输出，多行字符串常量则列在脚本的 `UNRENDERABLE` "
"集合中。请修改清单输入而不是生成的页面；脚本是确定性的，因此一轮已审阅的改动只会体现为很小的 diff。"

#: ../../site/maintainer/README.md:24
msgid ""
"Doxygen emits C++14 digit separators inside `<argsstring>`, which the Sphinx"
" C++ domain cannot parse, so `tools/normalize_doxygen_xml.py` must run "
"between `doxygen` and `sphinx-build`. `.readthedocs.yaml` and the `docs` "
"workflow do this; a local build is:"
msgstr ""
"Doxygen 会在 `<argsstring>` 中输出 C++14 数字分隔符，而 Sphinx C++ 域无法解析，因此必须在 `doxygen`"
" 与 `sphinx-build` 之间运行 `tools/normalize_doxygen_xml.py`。`.readthedocs.yaml` "
"与 `docs` 工作流都已如此做；本地构建步骤为："

#: ../../site/maintainer/README.md:29
msgid ""
"cd docs/site\n"
"doxygen Doxyfile\n"
"python tools/normalize_doxygen_xml.py ../_build/doxygen/xml\n"
"python tools/build_api_ledger.py\n"
"python tools/generate_api_pages.py\n"
msgstr ""
"cd docs/site\n"
"doxygen Doxyfile\n"
"python tools/normalize_doxygen_xml.py ../_build/doxygen/xml\n"
"python tools/build_api_ledger.py\n"
"python tools/generate_api_pages.py\n"

#: ../../site/maintainer/README.md:37
msgid "Translation"
msgstr "翻译"

#: ../../site/maintainer/README.md:39
msgid ""
"cd docs/site\n"
"sphinx-build -b gettext -W --keep-going . ../_build/gettext\n"
"sphinx-intl update -p ../_build/gettext -l zh_CN\n"
"# edit locale/zh_CN/LC_MESSAGES/*.po and clear fuzzy entries\n"
"FINCORE_DOCS_LANGUAGE=zh_CN sphinx-build -b html -W -n --keep-going . "
"../_build/html/zh_CN\n"
msgstr ""
"cd docs/site\n"
"sphinx-build -b gettext -W --keep-going . ../_build/gettext\n"
"sphinx-intl update -p ../_build/gettext -l zh_CN\n"
"# edit locale/zh_CN/LC_MESSAGES/*.po and clear fuzzy entries\n"
"FINCORE_DOCS_LANGUAGE=zh_CN sphinx-build -b html -W -n --keep-going . "
"../_build/html/zh_CN\n"

#: ../../site/maintainer/README.md:47
msgid ""
"`tools/apply_translations.py <catalog> <json>` fills a catalog from a msgid-"
"to-msgstr JSON mapping, which keeps bulk translations reviewable and avoids "
"hand-editing wrapping. Check the totals before committing:"
msgstr ""
"`tools/apply_translations.py <catalog> <json>` 按 msgid 到 msgstr 的 JSON "
"映射填充目录，使批量翻译保持可审阅，并避免手工处理换行。提交前先核对总数："

#: ../../site/maintainer/README.md:51
msgid "msgfmt --statistics -o /dev/null locale/zh_CN/LC_MESSAGES/**/*.po\n"
msgstr "msgfmt --statistics -o /dev/null locale/zh_CN/LC_MESSAGES/**/*.po\n"

#: ../../site/maintainer/README.md:55
msgid ""
"The untranslated set must stay exactly the reviewed identifier exemptions in"
" `docs/iterations/iteration-10-comments-bilingual-docs/exemptions.md`; any "
"other untranslated entry blocks the bilingual release."
msgstr ""
"未翻译集合必须恰好等于 `docs/iterations/iteration-10-comments-bilingual-"
"docs/exemptions.md` 中经审阅的标识符豁免；任何其它未翻译条目都会阻止双语发布。"

#: ../../site/maintainer/README.md:59
msgid ""
"Keep identifiers, commands, paths, formulas and code blocks literal. The "
"glossary uses returns=收益率, drawdown=回撤, volatility=波动率, horizon=预测期, "
"turnover=换手率, exposure=暴露 and annualization=年化."
msgstr ""
"保留标识符、命令、路径、公式和代码块的字面形式。术语表使用 "
"returns=收益率、drawdown=回撤、volatility=波动率、horizon=预测期、turnover=换手率、exposure=暴露、annualization=年化。"

#: ../../site/maintainer/README.md:63
msgid ""
"Doxygen auto-links are disabled (`AUTOLINK_SUPPORT = NO`) because reference "
"nodes cannot survive gettext: a translated paragraph that drops them fails "
"the strict build. Write cross-references explicitly in narrative pages "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"由于引用节点无法在 gettext 中保留（译文段落丢掉引用就会让严格构建失败），Doxygen 自动链接已被关闭（`AUTOLINK_SUPPORT "
"= NO`）。请改为在叙述页面中显式书写交叉引用。"

#: ../../site/maintainer/README.md:67
msgid "Generated artifacts"
msgstr "生成的产物"

#: ../../site/maintainer/README.md:69
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`docs/_build/` (Doxygen XML, gettext templates, `.mo`, HTML) is ignored. "
"`docs/site/locale/**/LC_MESSAGES/*.po` and `api-ledger*.{tsv,json}` are "
"source artifacts and should be committed when they change."
msgstr ""
"`docs/_build/`（Doxygen XML、gettext "
"模板、`.mo`、HTML）已被忽略。`docs/site/locale/**/LC_MESSAGES/*.po` 和 `api-"
"ledger*.{tsv,json}` 是源产物，变更时应提交。"

